          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "システム"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tail-high: high to the end, the drop on what follows." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尾高型：最後まで高く、続く助詞で下がります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the next page, or start over." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "次のページを撮るか、最初からやり直してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a line to see what was read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "行をタップすると、読み取った文字が見られます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a word to read it up close." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "言葉をタップすると、拡大して読み取ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The line runs over the high morae and falls where the accent does; the number is the mora after which it falls, 0 when it never does. Tokyo accent, from Kanjium." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "線は高い拍の上を通り、アクセントの位置で下がります。数字は何拍目のあとで下がるかで、0は下がらないことを表します。東京式アクセント、Kanjiumのデータによる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reading is always asked. With this on, the word is also asked for its meaning, on its own schedule." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "読みはいつも問われます。これをオンにすると、意味も別の予定で問われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
